{"id":"vod_md_5410","vodId":"5410","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"辉夜大小姐想让我告白：究极浪漫","name_cn":"辉夜大小姐想让我告白：究极浪漫","date":"2022-01-01","year":"2022","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"13集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230924-1/46f698052418297c1576df0a09ddd6c3.jpg"},"summary":"秀知院学园是秀才云集的精英学校，在学生会中担任学生会副会长四宫辉夜遇见了学生会长白银御行。原以为这两个任谁都觉得很登对的天才应该很快就会在一起，但这两人却因为过高的自尊心导致他们终没能向对方告白。“该用什么办法才能让对方向自己告白呢？”在这场恋爱头脑战中用尽各种智慧谋略、身经百战的两人，各自在心中下了某个决心。在秀知院学园高中部的文化祭“奉心祭”的最终日到来前，两人的恋情将会出现巨大的进展。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-24 04:30:26","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230923/NvcqNYFC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230923/zT7W5tg0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230923/x3PgqQ9i/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230923/VUdqylxf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230923/qPOZDFPb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230923/x1iEgEoh/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230923/6dUwmo9u/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230923/2ixCOj7q/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230923/bbVtklLD/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230923/CAvn4ce7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230923/k2emfxLA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230923/sp88YAio/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230923/5iOomhJn/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:40:38.744Z"}